1
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:05,570
This is Energy Twin: see the savings before you spend.

2
00:00:05,670 --> 00:00:10,550
A whole hotel portfolio at a glance: spend, carbon and savings potential.

3
00:00:10,650 --> 00:00:15,460
It tells you where to start: the best return per dollar.

4
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:18,670
Every hotel sits on a 3D map of Chicago.

5
00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:26,230
Click a hotel, and the camera flies in among the towers.

6
00:00:26,330 --> 00:00:32,440
Turn on columns, and each hotel's metric rises above it.

7
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:39,800
Give the chain one budget, and the optimizer splits it across the hotels.

8
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:45,500
Every dollar on this bar is a package the engine actually evaluated.

9
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:53,510
Open a hotel, and you get its digital twin: the building, its energy and its costs.

10
00:00:53,610 --> 00:01:01,770
Each zone is colored by what it costs.

11
00:01:01,870 --> 00:01:08,770
It's a living building. A January night, with the heating on…

12
00:01:08,870 --> 00:01:25,040
…and a July afternoon, with cooling at its peak.

13
00:01:25,140 --> 00:01:43,780
Press play, and a whole year goes by, hour by hour.

14
00:01:43,880 --> 00:01:54,830
Explode the floors to see inside.

15
00:01:54,930 --> 00:01:58,740
Follow the money from grid and gas to every zone.

16
00:01:58,840 --> 00:02:06,330
Switch to carbon, and gas suddenly matters more than its bill suggests.

17
00:02:06,430 --> 00:02:08,390
Ask a question in plain English.

18
00:02:08,490 --> 00:02:12,890
The AI runs the engine and explains. It never invents a number.

19
00:02:12,990 --> 00:02:18,410
One click puts the result on the twin.

20
00:02:18,510 --> 00:02:24,910
Now test a fix, like smart room controls.

21
00:02:25,010 --> 00:02:30,610
Then find the best investments for the budget. Every combination is tested.

22
00:02:30,710 --> 00:02:35,950
Here's the top package: its cost, yearly savings, payback and carbon.

23
00:02:36,050 --> 00:02:40,160
Apply it, and see before and after.

24
00:02:40,260 --> 00:02:48,060
And one click turns it into a report for the owner and the bank.

25
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:51,590
Back to the chain, right where you left it.

26
00:02:51,690 --> 00:02:56,690
Energy Twin. Simulate smarter. Spend better. Save energy.

